              "value": "Whirlwind Throw"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Requirements: The doprillu has a creature grabbed\n\nThe doprillu whirls the grabbed creature about, making a Body Strike against each creature in reach. After that Strike, the doprillu can hurl the grabbed creature up to 50 feet as a ranged Strike. This Strike has the same attack modifier and damage as Body Strike, but has the thrown 20 feet weapon trait."
